    <div class="grid">
      <span class="cmt">os</span><span>wsl2, arch on windows</span>
      <span class="cmt">shell</span><span>oh my zsh!</span>
      <span class="cmt">editor</span><span>vs code + claude code</span>
      <span class="cmt">stack</span><span>typescript · python · react · fastapi · postgresql</span>
      <span class="cmt">ai</span><span>agentic first · claude code runs the loop, i plan and review</span>
    </div>

    <footer><a href="/">← home</a> · <a href="/plain/uses">plain</a></footer>
